; Application-owned setup text. MUI supplies standard navigation in both languages.
LangString UpdateBlocked ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "无法自动升级：请关闭 nomozip 和命令行任务，并确认这是当前用户安装的目录。可重新运行下载的安装包。"
LangString UpdateBlocked ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Automatic upgrade could not start. Close nomozip and its command-line tasks, and check the registered installation directory. You can run the downloaded installer again."
LangString UpdateFailed ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "软件升级未完成。请重新运行下载的安装包修复安装；密码库和设置保留。"
LangString UpdateFailed ${LANG_ENGLISH} "The upgrade did not finish. Run the downloaded installer again to repair the installation. Your vault and settings are kept."
LangString UpdateRestartFailed ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "升级完成，但未能自动打开软件。请从开始菜单启动 nomozip。"
LangString UpdateRestartFailed ${LANG_ENGLISH} "The upgrade is complete, but nomozip could not reopen. Start it from the Start menu."
LangString Branding ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "nomozip · 解压与密码管理"
LangString Branding ${LANG_ENGLISH} "nomozip · Extraction and passwords"
LangString WelcomeTitle ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "安装 nomozip"
LangString WelcomeTitle ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Install nomozip"
!ifdef FRAMEWORK_DEPENDENT
  LangString WelcomeBody ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "保存解压密码，下次自动尝试。$\r$\n$\r$\n这是 ${ARCHITECTURE} 轻量版，使用系统共享的 .NET 10 Windows Desktop Runtime ${ARCHITECTURE}（10.0.12 或更高的 10.0 补丁版），无需 SDK。未安装运行库时，请先从 dotnet.microsoft.com 下载并安装。$\r$\n$\r$\n升级保留密码库、设置和下载的引擎，并清理上一安装的程序文件。安装前请关闭 nomozip。"
  LangString WelcomeBody ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Save extraction passwords and try them automatically next time.$\r$\n$\r$\nThis ${ARCHITECTURE} lightweight edition requires the shared .NET 10 Windows Desktop Runtime ${ARCHITECTURE} (10.0.12 or a later 10.0 patch). No SDK is needed. If missing, install the runtime from dotnet.microsoft.com first.$\r$\n$\r$\nUpgrades preserve your vault, settings, and downloaded engines while removing old application files. Close nomozip before installing."
!else
  LangString WelcomeBody ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "保存解压密码，下次自动尝试。$\r$\n$\r$\n仅为当前 Windows 用户安装，已包含 .NET 运行组件。升级会保留密码库、设置和已下载的引擎。$\r$\n$\r$\n软件仍为开发预览。安装前请关闭正在运行的 nomozip。"
  LangString WelcomeBody ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Save extraction passwords and try them automatically next time.$\r$\n$\r$\nInstalls for the current Windows user and includes the .NET runtime. Upgrades preserve your vault, settings, and downloaded engines.$\r$\n$\r$\nThis is a development preview. Close nomozip before installing."
!endif
LangString FinishBody ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "nomozip 已安装。可从开始菜单打开软件，或查看安装目录中的使用说明。"
LangString FinishBody ${LANG_ENGLISH} "nomozip is installed. Open it from the Start menu or read the instructions in the installation directory."
LangString CloseFirst ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "请先关闭 nomozip，再继续安装或卸载。文件暂未更改。"
LangString CloseFirst ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Close nomozip before installing or uninstalling. Files have not been changed."
LangString NeedArm64 ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "此版本需要 ARM64 Windows。"
LangString NeedArm64 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "This edition requires ARM64 Windows."
LangString NeedX64 ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "此版本需要 64 位 Windows。"
LangString NeedX64 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "This edition requires 64-bit Windows."
LangString UninstallTitle ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "卸载与本机数据"
LangString UninstallTitle ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Uninstall and local data"
LangString UninstallSubtitle ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "默认保留密码库和设置，便于重新安装后继续使用。"
LangString UninstallSubtitle ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Your vault and settings are kept by default for future installations."
LangString UninstallBody ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "卸载将移除程序和开始菜单入口。$\r$\n保存的密码、设置及下载的引擎默认保留在当前用户的本机目录中。"
LangString UninstallBody ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Uninstall removes the application and Start menu entries.$\r$\nSaved passwords, settings, and downloaded engines remain in the current user's local data directory by default."
LangString DeleteDataLabel ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "同时删除我的密码库、设置和已下载的引擎（无法恢复）"
LangString DeleteDataLabel ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Also delete my vault, settings, and downloaded engines (cannot be undone)"
LangString ConfirmDelete ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "确定删除本机保存的全部 nomozip 数据？$\r$\n密码库、设置和下载的引擎将无法恢复。"
LangString ConfirmDelete ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Delete all locally saved nomozip data?$\r$\nYour vault, settings, and downloaded engines cannot be recovered."
LangString InstallSection ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "安装"
LangString InstallSection ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Install"
LangString CleanupFailed ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "上一安装未能完成清理。请关闭 nomozip 后重试；本机密码库和设置保持不变。"
LangString CleanupFailed ${LANG_ENGLISH} "The previous installation could not be cleaned up. Close nomozip and retry. Your vault and settings are unchanged."
LangString InstalledName ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "nomozip 开发预览"
LangString InstalledName ${LANG_ENGLISH} "nomozip development preview"
LangString UninstallShortcut ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "卸载 nomozip.lnk"
LangString UninstallShortcut ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Uninstall nomozip.lnk"
